Error [jet.TypestateUnknownState]: `Dim` is not a declared state of `Lamp`
  --> tests/ui/typestate/state_list_move_names_unknown_state.jet:4:15
    |
  4 |         On -> Dim
    |               ^^^
 Why: Typestate: `Lamp: struct { state { … } }` defines the valid state labels; `Dim` is not among them — a typo here would silently create a phantom state that no transition reaches
 Fix: Add `Dim` inside `Lamp: struct { state { … } }`, or correct the spelling
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0151
